  B. They want to know how he is sending cars into space.  
  C. They think he is dangerous. 
  D. They suspect he is building a bomb. 
  Gold answer: B (2)

Q9: What happens to Solomon?
  A. He is arrested by the patrolmen for dumping junk into space. 
  B. He sells his business and works for NASA. 
  C. He becomes famous for being the crazy old man who polluted space. 
  D. He meets the President and is asked to share his discovery with the Air Force. 
  Gold answer: D (4)

