Q17: Did Solomon think he was doing something wrong?
  A. Yes, he worried what the Russians would do for the broken satellite.
  B. No, he figured that everyone else was sending things into space.
  C. Yes, he new he would get in trouble when the government found out.
  D. No, he was doing his patriotic duty.
  Gold answer: B (2)

